<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Semiconductor industry.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Semiconductor industry.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said PC related semiconductor companies are experiencing a significant change in PC OEM buying patterns as orders are getting noticeably stronger.</p>
<p>-- Noted a strong PC selling season should significantly burn down excess semiconductor inventories across most product lines.</p>
<p>-- Noted PC related semiconductor stocks that occupy leadership positions or participate in high growth areas offer attractive investment opportunities.</p>
</text>
